# Build artefacts are deliberately absent from this file.
#
# The generate check lists untracked files without excluding ignored ones,
# because its point is that nothing stray sits in the tree while generated
# output is compared. Hiding a stray binary here would defeat it: the check
# would still fail while git status looked clean, and the file that caused it
# would appear nowhere a reader would look. Delete the artefact instead.
#
# What follows is only what is genuinely per-machine or per-run.

# Coverage and profiling output.
*.prof
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Go workspace files, which stitch this module to a checkout of something else
# on one machine and mean nothing anywhere else.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Editor and OS noise.
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Per-machine agent configuration, which does not belong to the project.
# CLAUDE.md itself is tracked; only the local overrides are ignored.
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json

# The benchmarks module builds to a binary named after its directory.
/benchmarks/benchmarks
